    "sections": {
        "description": "Expert AC Repair is a professional, responsive, and user-friendly free theme tailored for HVAC businesses, AC repair services, air conditioning installation, heating and cooling services, air conditioner maintenance, ventilation system experts, refrigeration repair, air duct cleaning, furnace maintenance, HVAC contractors, appliance repair specialists, and cooling system technicians. With a clean, minimal, and modern layout, it offers a clutter-free interface that highlights services and builds customer trust. Built on a secure, optimized, and clean codebase with the Bootstrap framework, it ensures faster page load times, smooth performance, and compatibility across all devices. This multipurpose, SEO-friendly, and retina-ready theme includes dynamic features like a customizable banner, testimonial section, Call to Action (CTA) buttons, and a Team section to showcase expert technicians effectively. Enhanced with animations and mobile-friendly design, it delivers an interactive user experience that keeps visitors engaged. Offering flexible personalization options, shortcodes, multiple color palettes, and typography settings, it allows easy customization for both professionals and beginners. It integrates seamlessly with powerful plugins like WooCommerce for service bookings and online sales, Contact Form 7 for inquiry forms, Yoast SEO for better ranking, and Jetpack for enhanced performance and security. The translation-ready structure supports multilingual websites, making it ideal for global HVAC companies and local service providers alike. Whether you’re managing cooling, heating, or ventilation services, this theme provides everything you need to create a modern, functional, and high-performing website. Combining elegant design, smooth navigation, and professional functionality, the Expert AC Repair theme helps service providers boost their online presence, attract more clients, and build lasting trust through a visually appealing and technically advanced web experience."
    },
